flowchart LR
 Pilot[Radio handset + ELRS TX] <-->|RC + MAVLink RF| RX[Aircraft ELRS receiver]
 RX <-->|UART6| FC[AIO running ArduCopter]
 Laptop[Mission Planner OR custom application] <-->|UDP or serial| Bridge[TX Backpack or supported TX USB]
